title: snes-spc7110-python
message: >-
  If you use this work, or the states it was settled against, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-spc7110-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-spc7110-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the SPC7110 decompressor, the arithmetic coder that expands data on
  the way out of several late Super Nintendo cartridges. Its probability tables,
  its context model, and its three output modes are settled against a reference
  implementation rather than against a description of them.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - super-nintendo
  - spc7110
  - decompression
  - arithmetic-coding
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
